 * (constexpr float hypot(float,float) etc.) and _GLIBCXX_HAVE_*F/*L to
 * unlock the using::sinf etc. declarations in the C++98 section.
 *
 * Part of libsolcompat — https://github.com/Sunstorm-Project/libsolcompat
 */
